# Copy to the repo root as `.env` (not backend/.env -- config.py reads it from
# REPO_ROOT) and fill in when ready. Everything works without it -- PahadiBot
# just replies that it isn't connected yet (see app/llm.py).
#
# DASHBOARD_GROQ_API_KEYS takes a comma-separated pool of keys, tried in order;
# GroqLLMClient falls back to the next one only on a 429 (rate limit) response.
DASHBOARD_GROQ_API_KEYS=
DASHBOARD_GROQ_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b
